{
  "key": 33850,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_WreckedStonePillar",
      "en_US": [
        "There’s a wrecked stone pillar up\n",
        "ahead.\r",
        "I wonder what it is?\n",
        "It’s got me very curious."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_LetsGetTheShowStarted",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Ta-daah!\n",
        "Kept me waiting again, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}!\r",
        "Let’s see how much tougher you and\n",
        "I have gotten, right here and now!\r",
        "Hey, you’re a Trainer now. You’re\n",
        "expected to be ready for a battle.\r",
        "No whining! No waiting!\n",
        "Let’s get the show started!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_MyStrategyDoesntWork",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Waaah!\r",
        "It goes to show my surefire winning\n",
        "strategy doesn’t work.\r",
        "Say, hey, {STRVAR_1 3, 1, 0}.\n",
        "Remember what I told you before?\r",
        "Make sure all your attacks hit!\n",
        "Avoid every enemy attack!\r",
        "I thought that was a wicked strategy,\n",
        "but it doesn’t work worth beans.\r",
        "I guess I have to grind it out and\n",
        "toughen up the team a bit at a time.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_SovereignMaidHelp",
      "en_US": "Help! Help!"
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_SovereignMaidThugs",
      "en_US": [
        "Weirdly dressed thugs have taken\n",
        "over the Pokémon Mansion!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_SovereignMaidInformEveryone",
      "en_US": [
        "I must inform everyone in the hope\n",
        "that we receive aid...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Route209GateToHearthomeCity_Text_SovereignRivalHelpTheLady",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}: Woah! That was a surprise!\r",
        "The Pokémon Mansion is that huge\n",
        "building on Route 212, yeah?\r",
        "Weirdly dressed thugs... Does she\n",
        "mean those strange Team Galactic guys?\r",
        "Those goons must have decided\n",
        "they want something from there...\r",
        "I’m off then!\n",
        "To help a lady in distress!\r"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
